{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"5d1318a7e6ca5582",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This room allows you to draft repeated rooms during a run by adding a copy for every room I already have in a house.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-540,
			"y":-120,
			"width":420,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"54ef3967a95a8091","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_EuS7oiK2Ek.png","x":-540,"y":-380,"width":420,"height":236},
		{
			"id":"3def4baf572d602c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This room helps the task of [[Draft a Mechanarium with 8 doors.canvas|Draft a Mechanarium with 8 doors]], because sometimes there are only 6-7 draftable Mechanical Rooms. But isn't really necessary.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-540,
			"y":20,
			"width":420,
			"height":140
		},
		{"id":"e1506ae4599034ca","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_GWZxHgHRqu.png","x":-800,"y":260,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"1117a7a0342c1b88","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_DHnZlSn0Q7.png","x":-360,"y":260,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"ccad15667ed21695","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_9qjhVNixpx.png","x":-800,"y":520,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"8f5b4e199b713d11","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_f5dSz9zw5k.png","x":-360,"y":520,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"8bfad778fe76aeeb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Key",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-290,
			"y":780,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"246d2b8309c8ca24","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_VB9krOiOSC.png","x":-800,"y":780,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"2dfb330098abd023",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"If you enter the inverted area by going to the top, you can find random permanent copies of room floorplans on the cabinets, these copies will be added permanently to your drafting pool.\n\nThis means that they increase your chance of drafting those duplicated rooms and also will allow you to draft them multiple times per run, without the need of drafting a Chamber of Mirrors.\n\nThis is potentially game breaking or game ruining depending on how you use it.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-900,
			"y":-380,
			"width":340,
			"height":470
		},
		{
			"id":"450a2a7e797a1676",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The room itself has rewards such as coins or gold multiplied by the 4 on the corners.\n\nIf you enable the teleport to go above, you can go to the inverted area, the inverted area has copies of existing floorplans that can be permanently added to your \"drafting pool\".\n\nYou can get stuck if you press a button and then go to an area that will be closed, killing the run.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-90,
			"y":-380,
			"width":350,
			"height":400
		}
	],
	"edges":[
		{
			"id":"f200f9738f7f6f5e",
